  "body": "Finding a home that truly works for every stage of family life isn't easy. Finding one in the Rangitoto College zone, with sea views, flexible living, and room for everyone? That's even rarer.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a freehold site in the heart of Rothesay Bay, this beautifully maintained family home has been lovingly cared for and thoughtfully upgraded over the past 13 years. Every improvement has been made with comfort and practicality in mind, allowing the next owners to simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, the spacious layout offers four/five bedrooms, three bathrooms, and multiple living areas, making it ideal for multi-generational families, growing teenagers, or grandparents wanting their own space. With ensuite bathrooms and flexible living zones, everyone can enjoy both connection and privacy.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the modern kitchen, flowing effortlessly into light-filled open-plan living and dining before opening onto expansive decks and outdoor entertaining areas. Whether you're hosting family celebrations, summer barbecues, or simply relaxing with a morning coffee, the elevated sea views provide a beautiful backdrop.\r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced freehold section offers plenty of space for children and pets to play, while still leaving room to explore the possibility of adding a swimming pool and creating your own backyard oasis (subject to council approval).\r\n\r\nLocation is another reason families love this address. Children can walk to Browns Bay Primary, while older students are zoned for the highly sought-after Rangitoto College, with excellent local schools and public transport all within easy reach. Beaches, cafés, shops, and coastal walkways are just minutes away, making every weekend feel like a holiday.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It\r\n* Freehold family home in sought-after Rothesay Bay\r\n* Top school zones including Rangitoto College\r\n* Four/Five bedrooms and three bathrooms\r\n* Multiple living areas for flexible family living\r\n* deal for multi-generational families, teenagers or grandparents\r\n* Ensuite bathrooms offering extra comfort and privacy\r\n* Modern kitchen with quality finishes\r\n* Double glazing throughout\r\n* Ducted central gas heating plus underfloor heating\r\n* Elevated sea views\r\n* Expansive decks and outdoor entertaining areas\r\n* Fully fenced garden with potential to add a swimming pool (subject to council approval)\r\n* Walk to Browns Bay Primary, beaches, cafes and local shops\r\n\r\nFor over 13 years, this has been a home where family memories have been made, children have grown, and every corner has been cared for with pride.\r\n\r\nNow, the vendors are ready for their next chapter and are committed to achieving a sale.\r\n\r\nIf you've been waiting for a spacious family home in one of the North Shore's most desirable school zones, this is your opportunity. We encourage your inspection and welcome your offer.\r\n\r\nhttp://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34523c",
